================================================================================
Model sources and licenses
================================================================================

The public model catalog exposes the exact Hy-MT2 MLX conversions below and
TranslateGemma MLX conversions after the user accepts the applicable Google
Gemma Terms of Use. The Chrome extension does not contain model weights. The
native host downloads a pinned revision, or a separately published offline
model bundle may be installed alongside it.

  - Hy-MT2 1.8B Q4 — mlx-community/Hy-MT2-1.8B-4bit — Apache-2.0 —
    Tencent Hunyuan — https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy-MT2-1.8B
  - Hy-MT2 7B Q4 — mlx-community/Hy-MT2-7B-4bit — Apache-2.0 —
    Tencent Hunyuan — https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy-MT2-7B

  - TranslateGemma 4B Q4 — mlx-community/translategemma-4b-it-4bit —
    Google Gemma Terms of Use —
    https://huggingface.co/google/translategemma-4b-it
  - TranslateGemma 12B Q4 — mlx-community/translategemma-12b-it-4bit —
    Google Gemma Terms of Use —
    https://huggingface.co/google/translategemma-12b-it

TranslateGemma is not Apache-2.0. Its model weights and derivatives are
subject to Google's Gemma Terms of Use. The app links to those terms, requires
the user to confirm them before the first download, records the terms revision
accepted, and writes the required model-directory notice:

    Gemma is provided under and subject to the Gemma Terms of Use found at ai.google.dev/gemma/terms

The Terms of Use require applicable use restrictions and notices to accompany
redistribution. A distributor must retain the terms and restrictions for every
recipient. Gemma 4 models are not supported by this distribution. See
docs/model-licenses.md for exact revisions and release rules.

Translation is performed locally by the MLX host. No cloud translation API,
provider account, or API key is redistributed by this project.
